        "id": 11,
        "title": "XML Audit & Auto-Fix",
        "description": "Scan and fix layout XML files to ensure all required IDs exist and fix any structural issues like unclosed tags, invalid enums, and unsupported attributes.",
        "details": "1. Create a utility class `XmlAuditor` to scan all XML files in `app/src/main/res/layout/`\n2. Check for:\n   - Unclosed/self-closing tags\n   - Invalid enum values (e.g., `gravity=\"space_between\"`)\n   - Unsupported attributes (e.g., `orientation` on `RelativeLayout`)\n   - Bad `GridLayout` values (e.g., `rowCount=\"auto\"`)\n3. Verify all required IDs exist in respective layouts:\n   - Checklist: `checklist_images`, `checklist_timers`, `checklist_permissions`, `btn_continue`, `progress_bar`, `progress_text`\n   - Dashboard: `btn_start`, `btn_pause_resume`, `btn_end`, `tv_interval_value`, `tv_images_value`, `last_duration`, `last_unlocks`, `last_nudges`\n   - Image Library: `btn_add_images`, `btn_select_all`, `btn_delete_selected`, `btn_add_first_images`, `image_grid`, `image_grid_container`, `empty_state`, `image_count_info`, `bottom_count`\n   - Overlay: `reminder_image`, `btn_lock_phone`, `btn_snooze`, `btn_extend`\n   - Timer Setup: `input_duration`, `input_interval`, `btn_start_session`\n4. Replace missing fonts with system fonts\n5. Generate a patch file with all changes",
        "testStrategy": "1. Run AAPT to verify no XML errors\n2. Run Android Lint to check for warnings\n3. Manually verify each layout inflates without crashes\n4. Create a test that programmatically checks all required IDs exist in their respective layouts",
        "priority": "high",
