      {
        "id": 15,
        "title": "Navigation Graph & Fragment Setup",
        "description": "Create the navigation graph and set up all fragments with ViewBinding to enable screen navigation flow.",
        "details": "1. Create `nav_graph.xml` in `res/navigation/`:\n   ```xml\n   <navigation xmlns:android=\"http://schemas.android.com/apk/res/android\"\n     xmlns:app=\"http://schemas.android.com/apk/res-auto\"\n     android:id=\"@+id/nav_graph\"\n     app:startDestination=\"@id/welcomeFragment\">\n     \n     <fragment android:id=\"@+id/welcomeFragment\"\n       android:name=\"com.nudgr.ui.welcome.WelcomeFragment\"\n       android:label=\"Welcome\">\n       <action android:id=\"@+id/action_welcome_to_checklist\"\n         app:destination=\"@id/checklistFragment\" />\n     </fragment>\n     \n     <fragment android:id=\"@+id/checklistFragment\"\n       android:name=\"com.nudgr.ui.checklist.ChecklistFragment\"\n       android:label=\"Checklist\">\n       <action android:id=\"@+id/action_checklist_to_permissions\"\n         app:destination=\"@id/permissionsFragment\" />\n       <action android:id=\"@+id/action_checklist_to_imageLibrary\"\n         app:destination=\"@id/imageLibraryFragment\" />\n       <action android:id=\"@+id/action_checklist_to_timerSetup\"\n         app:destination=\"@id/timerSetupFragment\" />\n     </fragment>\n     \n     <fragment android:id=\"@+id/permissionsFragment\"\n       android:name=\"com.nudgr.ui.permissions.PermissionsFragment\"\n       android:label=\"Permissions\">\n       <action android:id=\"@+id/action_permissions_to_checklist\"\n         app:destination=\"@id/checklistFragment\" />\n     </fragment>\n     \n     <fragment android:id=\"@+id/imageLibraryFragment\"\n       android:name=\"com.nudgr.ui.imagelibrary.ImageLibraryFragment\"\n       android:label=\"Image Library\">\n       <action android:id=\"@+id/action_imageLibrary_to_checklist\"\n         app:destination=\"@id/checklistFragment\" />\n     </fragment>\n     \n     <fragment android:id=\"@+id/timerSetupFragment\"\n       android:name=\"com.nudgr.ui.timer.TimerSetupFragment\"\n       android:label=\"Timer Setup\">\n       <action android:id=\"@+id/action_timerSetup_to_dashboard\"\n         app:destination=\"@id/dashboardFragment\" />\n     </fragment>\n     \n     <fragment android:id=\"@+id/dashboardFragment\"\n       android:name=\"com.nudgr.ui.dashboard.DashboardFragment\"\n       android:label=\"Dashboard\">\n       <action android:id=\"@+id/action_dashboard_to_summary\"\n         app:destination=\"@id/summaryFragment\" />\n     </fragment>\n     \n     <fragment android:id=\"@+id/summaryFragment\"\n       android:name=\"com.nudgr.ui.summary.SummaryFragment\"\n       android:label=\"Summary\">\n       <action android:id=\"@+id/action_summary_to_dashboard\"\n         app:destination=\"@id/dashboardFragment\" />\n     </fragment>\n   </navigation>\n   ```\n2. Create a base fragment class for common functionality:\n   ```kotlin\n   abstract class BaseFragment<T : ViewBinding> : Fragment() {\n     private var _binding: T? = null\n     protected val binding get() = _binding!!\n     \n     abstract fun getViewBinding(inflater: LayoutInflater, container: ViewGroup?): T\n     \n     override fun onCreateView(inflater: LayoutInflater, container: ViewGroup?, savedInstanceState: Bundle?): View? {\n       _binding = getViewBinding(inflater, container)\n       return binding.root\n     }\n     \n     override fun onDestroyView() {\n       super.onDestroyView()\n       _binding = null\n     }\n   }\n   ```\n3. Implement each fragment class with proper ViewBinding\n4. Set up MainActivity with NavHostFragment:\n   ```kotlin\n   @AndroidEntryPoint\n   class MainActivity : AppCompatActivity() {\n     private lateinit var binding: ActivityMainBinding\n     private lateinit var navController: NavController\n     \n     override fun onCreate(savedInstanceState: Bundle?) {\n       super.onCreate(savedInstanceState)\n       binding = ActivityMainBinding.inflate(layoutInflater)\n       setContentView(binding.root)\n       \n       val navHostFragment = supportFragmentManager.findFragmentById(R.id.nav_host_fragment) as NavHostFragment\n       navController = navHostFragment.navController\n     }\n   }\n   ```",
        "testStrategy": "1. Create navigation tests using Navigation Testing API\n2. Test each navigation action to ensure correct destination\n3. Verify back stack behavior works as expected\n4. Test fragment lifecycle methods are called correctly\n5. Manually navigate through all screens to verify UI rendering",
        "priority": "high",
        "dependencies": [
          11,
          13
